      <problem>
        <paragraph>Let $$f(x) = \frac{x}{\sqrt{1 - \cos 2x^{}}}$$ .</paragraph>
        <list type="ordered">
          <item>Graph $$f$$ . What type of discontinuity does it appear to have at $$0$$ ?</item>
          <item>Calculate the left and right limits of $$f$$ at $$0$$ . Do these values confirm your answer to part (a)?</item>
        </list>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
